Letting your pet kill things for you is basically a
Good Thing. One problem you should be aware of is;
if you completely rely on pets and forget to advance
levels yourself you may get troubles when your pet
dies or gets separated from you (by level teleporters
or trapdoors, for example). And you maybe also want
your pet abstain from killing some specific monsters.
Pet application and management is a proficiency for
successful play.

